            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was great but need another 1/2 ounce of whiskey if not more. Normally I steer clear of raw eggs but I have chickens and their \"chatter\" lets me know within seconds that they've laid an egg so I'm confident they are truly fresh. If you like Bailey's, this is one worth trying. Again, needs more whiskey in my opinion but this is one I will make again.",
            "datePublished": "2021-05-11T01:56:37.600Z"
          },
